/The MASSIVE update for SvZ Extra 5.4.5!\

• New Game Modes
- Multiplayer: Challenge other players in 1v1 across different maps!
- Endless: Fight countless waves of enemies to get high score!
- Challenge: Beat challenging waves to earn special rewards!
- Kunoichi: Play as Kunoichi on her own story for a different unique playstyle!

• Balance
- Waves' length: The bloated waves that were unnecessarily long has been reduced
- Difficulty Modes: You can now choose 5 different modes from Baby (basically cheat), Easy, Normal, Hard (Default) and Hell (Locked until you beat Hard mode) to fit your needs if things are too difficult. Requires an restart button to switch onto another mode.
- Achievements: You can earn coins & glus from completing achievements!

• Extra Things
- New Maps: Customly made new maps for allies & enemies to battle on!
- Music Player: Listen to variety of newly added musics from different waves!
- Non-Phonk Music: Added an option to turn off phonk musics to swap with non-phonk musics
- Almanac: Check out each enemies' description & stats in Almanac after defeating them!
- Qualty of Life Features: Music & sound volume options, an try again screen to restart or quit after defeat, added additional stats display to Komusou, Swordsmith & Assassin
- Anti-Ai arts: Replaced ai arts with edited arts instead to fit more with SvZ artstyle
- Secrets: Uncover some new secrets to find out what they are!

